			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I'm really not. Putting \"supply chain\" burdens on ordinary people is exploitative and abusive behavior by capitalists.</p><p>What I want to see is npm's \"lol here's a million random-provenance micro-deps\" model burned to the ground. I'm happy to see it keep being a source of vulns until it's abandoned.</p>",
